VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT aftershock.native-cycle-receipt-integrity
GOAL
  Verify the native producer receipt for every observed business cycle.
CLAIM native-cycle-receipts REQUIRED
  ENSURE each business cycle has an internally consistent trace-linked receipt, note, sources and critic evidence
VERIFY native-cycle-receipts
  USING aftershock.native
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
